<h1>Welcome!</h1>
<p>First of all, we in the IAESTE Málaga Local Committee want to welcome you to our website. This area is dedicated to trainees who come from all over the world, and its purpose is to provide all the necessary information that will make you spend your time here in the best way possible.</p>
<p>We are here to ensure your internship is as valuable and enjoyable as it can be. Sure, you come here to work, but enjoying the place you live in is also a crucial part of this experience. Therefore, we run a series of social and cultural events for you to attend in the summer and some others during the rest of the year.</p>
<p>Apart from organized activities, you can also go on trips alone, both within our city and to other interesting places in Andalucía. In the different sections of this page, you’ll find information about museums, sightseeing, monuments, where to eat, nightlife, transport and more.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>You can also check out our Welcome Guide, which has lots of useful information about transport, money, communication, and more!</p>
<p><strong>If you have any questions, please email us at incomingiaestemalaga@gmail.com</strong></p>
<h3><span style="font-size: 1.5em; line-height: 1.5em;">Málaga. Brilliant in every sense</span></h3>
<p>Discover all the attractions on offer in the towns in the Malaga area.<br>
TE ESPERAMOS!!!</p>
